/E (In this module, you'll explore the fundamentals of AI agents, understanding what they are and how they function. You'll dive into the differences between Agentic AI, AI Agents, and Generative AI. The module will also introduce you to multi-agent systems and various frameworks used to build them. By the end, you will have a strong grasp of agent-based AI concepts, preparing you to work with agentic AI frameworks in real-world applications.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [0]
