<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (In this module, you'll explore Langchain Expression Language \(LCEL\) for building AI-powered workflows. You'll start by working with open-source models using the Groq API. Next, you'll learn how to construct LLMs, prompts, and structured output chains using LCEL. Finally, you'll deploy LCEL components as APIs using Langserve, making them accessible for real-world applications. By the end, you'll have the skills to create and deploy LCEL-based AI solutions efficiently.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [0]
>>
