/E (This module covers the full deployment pipeline for AI agents, providing hands-on experience with essential DevOps tools such as GitHub Actions, Docker, and cloud platforms like AWS S3, ECR, EC2, and Bedrock. You'll also explore model serving with BentoML. After mastering these deployment concepts, you'll work on multiple end-to-end Agentic AI projects, applying these skills to real-world scenarios. By the end of this module, you'll be equipped to deploy, manage, and scale AI agents efficiently.)
